%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh? Really...?\d%K%P
「诶，是这样吗…？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYep. Our Laid-off #2 is now Employed #2.\d%K%P
「没错。\n失业二号妹子，可喜可贺地升格为了『正式职员二号妹子』」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWhile Laid-off has been unable to find a... third place\nfor a while now, she got herself a position on her second\nday of job hunting.\d%K%P
「明明失业者的再再就职活动还在进行中，\n她在就职活动的第二天干脆地拿到正式录用了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dSometimes, reality can be harsher than fiction. Young\nMaster, how long are you planning on loitering around\nwithout a job?\d%K%P
「诶～，真实有的时候比故事更为残酷呢…\n『呐，小少爷，你不去找工作，\n想在这排房闲晃到什么时候啊？』」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...I sure hope this story will have an actual\nconclusion.\d%K%P
「…你这句评书，收场噱头是有的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm not loitering around!\nI'm looking for a job every day! I'm even working part-\ntime!\d%K%P
「才没有无所事事地闲晃！\n每天也有好好地去找工作，打工也有在做啊」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dEither way, you have been left behind. I thought Kaya\nwould opt to wait until you got yourself a job, at least.\d%K%P
「不管怎样，这样的话不就出现差异了嘛。\n我之前，一直以为夏夜小姐在失业者正式就职之前\n都会等待着的」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYou know, I feel she's not all over Laid-off like she\nused to be, and I don't even see her going to his room at\nnight anymore.\d%K%P
「但是她最近也没像从前那样黏着失业者，\n也没再去失业者的房间夜袭啊」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dShe was going to his room at night?! Why didn't you tell\nme about that?!\d%K%P
「她从前还这么干了！？\n话说，为什么在注意到的时候不喊我啊！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWell, I suppose that means our beloved Ms. #2 has finally\nescaped the Young Master's curse. Although, I'm not\nentirely sure how she got involved with him to that extent\nin the first place.\d%K%P
「嘛，不如说是二号小姐，也终于从小少爷的诅咒中逃出来了呢。\n…不过她最开始是怎么缠上他的可完全是个谜」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dStill, there are two possibilities when something like\nthis happens. They have either split up for good... or the\ncomplete opposite.\d%K%P
「这个时候需要分两种情况进行考虑了。\n有一种可能是真的对他死心了。\n还有一种…就是完全相反的情况」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dAnd which one do you think it is?\d%K%P
「你觉得是哪一种？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIf I were a woman, I surely wouldn't want to be involved\nwith Laid-off right now. I mean, he's a nice guy and all,\nbut everything he touches gets tainted by misfortune.\d%K%P
「如果我是女的的话，肯定是不会缠着现在的小少爷的。\n那个人，已经超越了认真和踏实的好人的地步，\n拥有着触碰过的一切都会变得不幸的超级背运喔？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dIn a way, it's pretty incredible that despite trying so\nhard, he's actually in the same position as when we do\nnothing.\d%K%P
「明明和我们不一样，非常拼命地在努力，\n到最后却和我们落到了同样的境地，这在某种意义上也很厉害啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIf you're aware of that, then please try finding a job,\nKuma...\d%K%P
「有自知之明的话就去工作啊熊崎先生…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThat said, we're talking about Laid-off #2 here, who\nhappens to be head over heels for that hopeless man. I\nvery much doubt we can apply common sense to her\nunorthodox taste.\d%K%P
「但是再怎么说对方可是最喜欢那个废柴男的二号妹子啊。\n那个姑娘选男人的基准实在是已经丧失了理性…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dAll right. Does that mean you're betting on them being\ntogether? Then I'm betting two months' worth of rent on\ntheir relationship being all over!\d%K%P
「好的，那么八觉得他俩还没断？\n我觉得他俩已经断了，赌两个月房租！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOkay, I'm betting one month's worth as well.\nI'm pretty sure even her blind love has its limits.\d%K%P
「那我也来一个月的吧。\n我觉得这次她终究是仁至义尽了吧？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dGuys, wait a second! Are you saying I have to bet three\nmonths of rent on the idea that Laid-off actually got\nlucky? That's like buying the stocks of a company going\nbankrupt.\d%K%P
「不对等一下再稍微等一下！\n相信失业者的运气把三个月的房租赌进去的话，\n不就像是包了快要停牌的垃圾股一样吗！？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dAren't you lucky? The value's dropping like crazy, so\nyou'll be able to buy a lot.\d%K%P
「不是挺好的吗。\n反正也快跌停了，能买很多喔？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSeriously, guys... Ah.\d%K%P
「你们这些人…啊」%K%P
%LC???
%LC？？？
\dYou seem to be having fun.\nWhat's up?\d%K%P
「好像很开心啊，聊什么呢？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWe were discussing whether or not Laid-off #1 and #2\nsplit up.\d%K%P
「关于失业的和二号妹子可能分手的话题」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dAt the moment, it's two against one that they did.\d%K%P
「现在的话，分手论正在以２比１领先」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWait, I never said I accepted that bet!\d%K%P
「不不所以说我根本就没说要参加！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI mean, the fact they stayed together for so long was odd\nenough to begin with. Don't you agree, Ms. #2?\d%K%P
「说回来，现在没有分开才显得奇怪了吧。\n你也是这么想的吧，二号小姐？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh? That sounds like fun.\nCan I join the betting?\d%K%P
「诶，好像很有趣。\n呐，我也来下注好吗？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dUm, I don't think that'd be fair, given your position.\d%K%P
「不，你这样的已经算是内部人员了吧。\n这就不公平了呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhat? Cheapskate!\d%K%P
「诶～，小气」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I'm actually impressed you're able to continue talking\nabout it even in front of the concerned party.\d%K%P
「…真亏你们在本人面前还能自然地继续讨论这个话题呢」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWell, if we started panicking now, it would look almost\nlike we were having fun gossiping about you behind your\nback or something.\d%K%P
「毕竟如果现在还慌慌张张的，\n不就像是我们几个长舌妇在热闹地搬弄是非了嘛」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut you -were- gossiping. And having fun doing it, too.\d%K%P
「你们本来就是在搬弄是非吧。\n本来就很热闹吧」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dThat aside, congratulations on finding employment, Ms.\n#2. Why don't we celebrate it tonight?\d%K%P
「不是不是，话说回来，二号小姐，\n再就业什么的难道不是可喜可贺吗？\n今晚不来开个聚会吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd now you're trying to change the subject.\d%K%P
「而且你这不是在打马虎眼吗」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, that's a good idea!\nI just hope I'll be able to survive for seven days this\ntime around.\d%K%P
「啊～，不错呢。\n算上今晚，还能活七天也不错」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...When did you have the time to get that far into it?\d%K%P
「…事情什么时候到那个地步了啊？」\n※译注：这两句NETA游戏《美妙世界》。“顺利生存7天！如果不能便会被抹杀你的存在”。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSorry, but tomorrow would work better for me. I'm on my\nway to have a bath right now.\d%K%P
「啊～，但是抱歉。拜托改到明天吧。\n现在我必须要去洗澡了」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWe could always do it after you come back.\d%K%P
「洗完澡应该还有时间的吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm planning to take my time.\d%K%P
「今天是长泡之日啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...Didn't know you were such a bath lover.\d%K%P
「…还真是风流啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, I'll be on my way, then.\d%K%P
「那么我就走啦♪」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...What do you think?\nIt felt like she got even sexier than before.\d%K%P
「…呐，你怎么想？\n总感觉她现在越来越色气了呢」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dIf Laid-off really doesn't get enticed by the sight of\nthat back, he must be either into me or Kuma. There's no\nother explanation.\d%K%P
「对那个背影产生不了欲望的失业者，\n不管怎么想，本命都是我或者小熊吧」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dIs Mr. Retired out of the question?!\d%K%P
「为什么没老爷子的事啊！？」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell then, let's have a toast.\d%K%P
「那么，我们来干杯吧」\n※译注：背景和《妈妈LOVE》为同一公园。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dTo what?\d%K%P
「为什么干杯？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTo your new job.\d%K%P
「当然是为了夏夜小姐的再就职啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCongratulations, Kaya. You're about to have a fresh\nstart, and I hope it goes well. So, best of luck! Cheers!\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐，真的是恭喜你了。\n请重新抖擞精神，从此开始努力吧！\n…干杯」%K%P
The sound of our beer cans clanging against each other was\nsomewhat lacking in festivity, but given our financial\nsituation, there was little we could do about it.%K%P
喝罐装发泡酒的同伴之间的干杯，\n在音量上果然还是欠缺了一些气势，\n但考虑到成本的话这也是没有办法的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNgh, ngh, ngh... pwhahh.\nCongratulations!\d%K%P
「咕、咕、咕…噗哈。\n恭喜了～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I couldn't tell if she was upset by such an underwhelming\ncelebration, but a shadow seemed to have clouded Kaya's\nface.%K%P
但是，这样小气的举杯大概还是不能被接受，\n在我之外的人，怎么看也不像是燃得起来的样子。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat's the matter?\nIt's best when it's hot, so go on -- help yourself.\d%K%P
「怎么了？\n刚烤好的东西最好吃了，请用吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...It's all sunshine and roses for you, huh.\d%K%P
「…明亮着呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, it still takes some time for the sun to set. But\nonce September rolls around, the days will start to get\ngradually darker.\d%K%P
「太阳下山还早着呢。\n但是到了９月的话这个点就要暗下来了吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThat's not what I meant...\d%K%P
「我不是这个意思啊…」%K%P
Kaya stared awkwardly at the yakitori I'd been trying to\nhand her, seemingly in no mood to actually take it.%K%P
夏夜小姐并没有接下我递出去的烤鸡，\n仍然是有一点不愉快的样子。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt didn't upset you at all?\nThat I took the job without telling you, I mean.\d%K%P
「心情…没有变得有些不快吗？\n毕竟我根本就没有和你商量，直接就擅自决定就职了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNope, not at all. I mean, I was the one who kept urging\nyou to find something to begin with. Besides...\d%K%P
「没，一点也不。\n再说了，我本来就是一直站在劝你再就业的立场上的吧？\n而且…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBesides...?\d%K%P
「而且？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI realize how tasteless it is of me to spell this out,\nbut... you did it for me, didn't you?\d%K%P
「虽然由我说来有点那啥…\n反正，这也是为了我吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Ah.\d%K%P
「………啊～」%K%P
Kaya's expression changed -- the uncomfortable fear of\nhurting me melted into the face of a child that had her\nprank found out by her parents.%K%P
从宛若在担心是否会让对方受伤一样的发窘的表情，\n变成了像是被家长发现了恶作剧的孩子的难为情的表情，\n她的脸上发生着这种微妙的变化。%K%P
Apparently, I was right on the mark.%K%P
虽然已经预料到了，但果然我的话语还是正中靶心。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know how pathetic a person I am, and all I ever do is\nworry you. But I don't think I'm so hopeless that I'd need\nyou to look out for me to such an extent.\d%K%P
「我知道我这个人很没出息。\n实在是让夏夜小姐操了太多的心。\n但是，我本来并不打算让你照顾我到这个地步的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYeah... I thought you'd say that.\d%K%P
「嗯…我能想到理君会这么说」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut I already know from experience that you won't listen\nto whatever I have to say.\d%K%P
「不过，就算这样夏夜小姐肯定也不会听这一点，\n通过积累到现在的经验，我也已经知道了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou know me well.\nCould this be... love?\d%K%P
「对我真是了解呢。\n…难道说，这就是爱？」%K%P
Kaya was ready to look after me, no matter how far I fell.%K%P
不管我陷入怎样的窘境，\n都不会抛弃我，一直照顾着我的夏夜小姐。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPerhaps.\d%K%P
「大概也可以这么说吧」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Whoa.\d%K%P
「…呜哇」%K%P
No matter how much of a pessimist I was, even I had to\nrealize that Kaya's actions might've been motivated by her\nfeelings for me.%K%P
已经来到了这一步，不管我有多悲观可怜，\n她都还是以我这个人来作为行动的基准。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAs such, I gave up on trying to convince you with words.\nIn exchange, though, I won't be taking any of your money.\d%K%P
「所以我已经不会再说什么啦。\n但与之相对的，我是绝对不会收下钱之类的东西的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYeah, I'll save up.\nMaybe one day, you'll need it for something big.\d%K%P
「嗯，我会存好的。\n毕竟理君，不知道什么时候可能就需要很多的钱了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, I don't think we're on the same page here...\d%K%P
「不，所以说啊…」%K%P
Every time I tried taking a firm stance on something,\nshe'd find a way to spoil me in an almost underhanded way.%K%P
回应着我这样有些毅然的『要去做』，\n她又切换到了对我放纵包容的模式。%K%P
She wasn't the kind of person who listened to others... Or\nrather, she handled everything in the way most convenient\nfor her... which also happened to benefit me.%K%P
还是老样子，微妙地不听别人说话呢…不如说，\n她是个按照自己方便的，同时也是我所心甘情愿的解释来行动的人啊。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou really are someone worth providing for. I love you.\d%K%P
「你真的是值得人竭尽全力的人呢，理君。\n真是的，最喜欢你了」%K%P
Her foolishness had reached a terminal stage.%K%P
她的这种愚昧…在某种意义上已经是末期症状了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... Thank you very much.\d%K%P
「那个………非常感谢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNmm!\d%K%P
「嗯～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dK-Kaya... We can't go further here... okay?\d%K%P
「夏、夏夜小姐，现在………\n稍微来一点吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dTlp... nm.\d%K%P
「啾…嗯」%K%P
And so, I decided it was useless to try and fight her\nailment, at least on the surface.%K%P
所以，我也开始对这个晚期患者，尽全力尝试最终的医疗手段。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
Two weeks had passed since I got laid off from Michihama\nTrading.%K%P
从我作为临时员工被道浜商事解约了算起…%K%P
Two weeks since we began our new kind of relationship.%K%P
也就是，从我们变成『这种关系』算起，\n已经过了两周。%K%P
I spent my mornings looking for a new job while working\npart-time in the evenings, essentially returning to my\nlifestyle from two months ago.%K%P
我又一次回到了上午找工作、下午打工——\n这样的两个月前的生活，从早上开始就不停地往返于职业介绍所和面试单位之间。%K%P
And once every two or three days -- after my evening shift\n-- Kaya and I would have one of those secret meetups that\nMr. Retired would no doubt describe as a tryst.%K%P
而我和夏夜小姐，在打工结束之后碰头，像这样偶尔…经常…\n两三天一次地，重复着有点像是老爷子所说的『幽会』。%K%P
To avoid any chance of unexpected encounters, we'd meet in\nWest Hagimori Park, on the opposite side of the station.%K%P
为了不让大家看到，\n我们特意把地点选在车站的另一侧的西萩守公园。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dPhew...\d%K%P
「呼…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHahh...\d%K%P
「唔、哈啊…」%K%P
By the time we exchanged the aftertaste of yakitori and\nbeer through our kiss, there were almost no passersby in\nthe area.%K%P
烤鸡和起泡酒的香气结束了在各自口中的交换的时候，\n我们的周围也终于没有了人影。%K%P
In other words, we were doing something fairly\nembarrassing in a semi-public place -- anyone could've\nseen us.%K%P
简单地说，我们刚才在众人的目光中，\n进行了一次稍微有点过头的羞耻ｐｌａｙ。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm really sorry.\d%K%P
「实在是、非常抱歉…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDon't be. It felt good.\nBesides, the night is still young.\d%K%P
「不，非常舒服哦？\n而且这个夜晚还很长呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wasn't talking about that!\d%K%P
「不不，不是说那个啦！」%K%P
I knew she'd say something like that.%K%P
话说，果然是『夜还很长』吗。%K%P
It was an enticing -- and deeply touching -- invitation,\nbut...%K%P
对于我来说，这是无法抵抗的充满魅力的话语，\n同时，也是如针扎一般刺痛着我的心的邀请。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf only I could pull myself together...\d%K%P
「那个…如果我能更可靠一点的话」%K%P
