I wondered why I was always able to be so honest with\nher... Perhaps because we came from the same area.%K%P
为什么我可以和这个人毫无顾虑地争论呢。\n这就是所谓的同乡之谊吗？%K%P
Although, Nagoya residents would likely be upset by\nhearing a man from Gifu say all that.%K%P
…不过如果被岐阜的人这么说的话，\n名古屋的人都会生气的吧。%K%P
