%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThe Mitsumaru Group got indicted this morning, just as it\nhad been planned. It's probably going to show up in the\nafternoon news.\d%K%P
「和计划一样，从今天早上开始地方检察厅的检察人员进入了三丸集团。\n从早间新闻开始，媒体一直在报道这件事」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Right, the 1st of September was the foretold day of\ndisaster.%K%P
这么说回来，今天是９月１日…防灾日！%K%P
Or the first day of autumn, if you were a normal person.%K%P
…不过暂时把这个放在一边，\n现在也已经进入了民间俗称的『秋』的月份。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dS-So Michihama Trading...\d%K%P
「那、那么道浜商事也…？」%K%P
Ms. Sawashima's prophecy from way back when was coming\ntrue.%K%P
泽嶋小姐说过的『到了秋天的话』，\n在这个瞬间，已经成为了现实。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dUnfortunately...\d%K%P
「虽然很遗憾…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dO-Oh no...\d%K%P
「这、这…」%K%P
In other words, with my failure to do anything of\nsignificance, my old place got dragged down alongside its\nparent company.%K%P
所以到最后，我没有帮上任何忙的那家公司，\n在顷刻之间还是被卷入了和总公司的丑闻之中…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dUnfortunately, it slipped away.\nSpecial investigations removed it from their targets.\d%K%P
「虽然很遗憾，但还是被忽略了。\n特捜部的所有人员，都把道浜商事排除在了搜索对象之外」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...That was a good move. I thought they were just a bunch\nof monkeys unable to think for themselves, but when push\ncame to shove, they suddenly displayed some incredible\ndecisiveness.\d%K%P
「…还有这么一手啊。\n本以为只是个印头鱼般的企业，\n没想到在紧要关头能果断做出决断」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What do you mean?\nDid Michihama survive?!\d%K%P
「怎、怎么回事？\n道浜、最后活下来了！？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIt definitely survived as a company, though I doubt\nthey'll be able to continue operating the same way they\nused to.\d%K%P
