%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIn any case, it looks like Michihama Trading successfully\nslipped away. The investigators that kept an eye on it\nmust be grinding their teeth right about now.\d%K%P
