「社长退居会长一职，实质上是隐退了。\n受到制裁的，是空降的那个董事班子还有…」%K%P
This was the fifth measure.%K%P
这是、方案５啊…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIt seems that the only one who got laid-off from their\ndirect employees over this period was one apprentice -- no\none else was affected in any other way.\d%K%P
