%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dMilady, that's...\d%K%P
「大小姐，这个…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHahaha...\d%K%P
「哈哈哈…」%K%P
The devil's deal on the last page that I was too afraid to\neven mention during my presentation.%K%P
在提案书的最后一页所记载，\n都没法作为规划发表的、那个与恶魔的交易。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAll you can do is laugh? Well, I can't really blame you.\nYou must be furious that they ended up using you as a\nconvenient scapegoat yet again.\d%K%P
「只能发出干笑了吗？\n这也难怪，从被裁人员这一边看的确完全…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHahaha... Ahahaha...! Yes! Yeeeah!\nChief Hiragi, you did it! You really did it!\d%K%P
「哈哈哈…啊哈哈哈…！\n太棒了！\n平木科长做到了啊！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThank goodness! I'm so relieved!\nHis long years as a reliable employee weren't just for\nshow!\d%K%P
「太好了…真的是太好了。\n果然，元老的力量不是闹着玩的…」%K%P
I had no idea how he managed to get the president to join\nhim on that outward rebellion against Mitsumaru, but he\ndid it.%K%P
如此短的时间，而且敌人还是三丸那一方，\n但是社长终于下了决断。%K%P
Chief Hiragi's last minute decisiveness and long-time\nconnections must've really paid off.%K%P
平木科长至今为止蓄积的行动力和人脉，\n终于有了用武之地。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhy are you celebrating?\nIf anything, you should hate them for this...\d%K%P
「什么事这么开心啊？\n你不应该是恨着那家公司的吗…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's all thanks to you!\nThank you very much! From the bottom of my heart!\d%K%P
「全是托您的福！\n实在是，非常感谢！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dKyah?!\d%K%P
「呀！？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dM-Mr. Yoshimura...\d%K%P
「芳、芳村先生…」%K%P
I clasped Ms. Sawashima's hand and vigorously shook it a\nfew times, receiving confused looks from both her and Mr.\nSasaki.%K%P
我握住泽嶋小姐的手来回地晃着，\n这让她和佐佐木先生都露出了惊愕的表情，看着我。%K%P
Well, of course...\nNot even I expected this to make me so happy.%K%P
这就是因为那个吧…\n因为没有想到，我竟然会这么地开心吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou were a good person, after all! A great one, in fact!\nYou might be in a bit of a gray area as far as common\nsense morality is concerned, but that doesn't matter right\nnow!\d%K%P
「你果然是个好人，大好人啊！\n虽然从道义上来说有些见不得人，但我会装作不知道的！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dMust you always add something at the end that ruins the\nsentiment? Do you have any idea how much trouble I could\nbe in if someone found out I leaked this?\d%K%P
「为什么在那个问题上说这么多啊！\n到底是因为谁的错才会泄露这样的机密…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI understand! I truly appreciate your courage to betray\nyour family, Ms. Sawashima!\d%K%P
「因为我明白的！\n真的非常感谢泽嶋小姐的背叛！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
