「…怎么回事儿啊，那是？」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCClerk
%LC家庭餐厅店员
\dMay I take your plate?\d%K%P
「请问这边的可以撤下了吗？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, thank you. Go ahead.\nAnyway, this is the list of schools that offer\nscholarships.\d%K%P
「啊，不好意思，拜托您了。\n嗯，这是有免费生制度的学校列表」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dLet's see...\d%K%P
「我来看看…」%K%P
We were having another of our little parent-teacher\nconferences. It gradually became a weekly occurrence.%K%P
最近，我们照例每周开一次『监护人座谈会』。%K%P
You could also call it somewhat of a strategy meeting to\nput Mitoko in a position she could no longer back down\nfrom, now that she finally showed interest in continuing\nher studies.%K%P
趁着终于想要升学的美都子\n还没有改变心意的时候向她发起迂回进攻，\n某种意义上，是一个毫不遮掩的作战会议。%K%P
Asami, despite her busy schedule, was using her own free\ntime to look up schools and assist us in general.%K%P
对于我这样的提议，麻实也挤出了时间，\n为了美都子的升学进行各种各样的尝试。%K%P
She must've felt uncomfortable just seeing my face, and I\nwas truly sorry about that, but I also really appreciated\nher help.%K%P
她大概是讨厌这样尴尬地和我见面吧，\n这让我觉得很对不起她，不过也着实令人感激。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMeisei Daifu Daisan, Kasugadai, Hachisouji...\nAh, that one's a sports scholarship, so let's just cross\nit out.\d%K%P
「明青大附第三、春日台、八藏寺…\n啊，这边都是体育免费生，就别看了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...All of them are pretty high-level schools, I see.\d%K%P
「…都是偏差值很高的学校呢」%K%P
Considering Mitoko's family situation, and the sad state\nof my own wallet, we decided that we had to go for a\nscholarship.%K%P
鉴于美都子家庭的问题，还有我的经济状况，\n我们决定的方案是『免费生考试』。%K%P
The idea gave Mitoko a motivating goal to strive towards,\nwhile also eliminating the possibility of budgetary\nexcuses.%K%P
可以激起美都子的干劲，\n也不会让学费成为升学的阻碍，这已经是最合理的策略了。%K%P
I had yet to tell her about this plan, though.%K%P
不过说回来，这还没有和她本人商量呢…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTakiyama Academy, Holy Catharsis Seminary, Hokuyou\nMinami... Ah.\d%K%P
「泷山学院、圣卡塔西斯女子、北洋南………啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat is it? Did you find something you like?\d%K%P
「怎么了？\n发现什么合适的了吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShuusen Preparatory...?\d%K%P
「秋泉大附属…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, it's the preparatory on the same grounds as Shuusen\nUniversity. It's famous for being an elite female\nacademy.\d%K%P
「啊啊，是秋泉大校园里面的附属学校啊。\n女生部也是有名的大小姐学园哦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know...\d%K%P
「我知道的…」%K%P
My neighbor was attending that university, after all.%K%P
是邻居小姐的母校…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDoesn't seem like they have any requirements in terms of\npedigree. Well, it's a scholarship to support those that\nlack the funds to afford the school, after all.\d%K%P
「说到免费生的条件…家庭水平似乎没什么要求呢。\n嘛，目的似乎是为了对优秀的学生提供经济援助」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShuusen Preparatory...\d%K%P
「秋泉大附吗…」%K%P
I didn't know they had scholarships, too.%K%P
存在着，免费生制度啊。%K%P
It had the image of a school for rich folks, so that was\nsurprising, to say the least.%K%P
印象中必须要有很多钱才能进入的，\n稍微有些意外啊。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThis place is the toughest one on the list, though.\nBesides, we don't even know if Mitoko herself would want\nto attend it.\d%K%P
「但是，在其它的地方会更加严格，对学习水平的要求会更高哦？\n而且美都子，到底是不是想去这儿呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...From this list, it's probably the one she'd pick.\d%K%P
「…我觉得在里面挑的话，她大概会选这个的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dReally? Does she have a particular attachment to it?\d%K%P
「是这样吗？\n是她憧憬的学校吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNot really the place itself, but rather one of its\ngraduates.\d%K%P
「比起憧憬学校，她更憧憬一名毕业生啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHmm...?\d%K%P
「哼嗯…？」%K%P
Asami gave me an unconvinced nod.%K%P
听到我别有他意的话语，\n麻实似乎没能理解，但还是点了点头。%K%P
However, I felt pretty certain I was right.%K%P
但是对我来说，已经有了把握。%K%P
Those two most definitely weren't faking their friendship,\nand I could probably get all sorts of information about\nthe exams from our amiable neighbor. It was perfect.%K%P
那两个人的良好关系多半是真实的，\n而且在考试前大概也能获得各种各样的信息，\n不安要素也就比较少了。%K%P
Perhaps she would even help me convince Mitoko if she\ndecided to change her mind again.%K%P
找『她』商量一下也许会不错。\n说不定她还会开心地帮我说服美都子…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAll right... let's go with this.\d%K%P
「好…那就去干吧」%K%P
Mitoko's future was finally looking bright.\n...As for my own, it remained dark, as always.%K%P
美都子的将来有了希望，这就是收获。\n…不过我的未来还是乌云密布就是了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWell then, if we're finished with this, how about we\norder some dessert?\d%K%P
「好了，这样的话意见就统一了…\n要来份甜点吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, um... I'm not sure if I can afford that right now.\d%K%P
「啊，不…资金十分紧张」%K%P
After all, it had already been seventeen months since I\ngot my last salary.%K%P
毕竟『月薪』这种东西，\n差不多已经有１７个月远离我了。%K%P
I was making ends meet with part-time jobs, but I had yet\nto rise to the level where I could actually afford\ndesserts and such... even the kind sold at family\nrestaurants...%K%P
虽然还有周薪啊日薪啊乱七八糟的收入，但以现在的我这种身份，\n即使是在名叫家庭餐厅的合理价位的饭馆，\n也肯定是叫不起餐前酒和甜点的…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOh, don't worry about it.\nIt's my treat tonight.\d%K%P
「别在意这种事啦。\n只是一顿饭而已，我还是可以请的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can't let you do that...\d%K%P
「这可不行…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOh, don't be like that. I know you'd help me in a\nheartbeat if our positions were reversed.\d%K%P
「别在意这么多啦。\n有困难的时候就应该互相帮助吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut this would make it look like...\d%K%P
「但是这样的话…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dLike what?\d%K%P
「这样的话？」%K%P
Being treated to dinner by a woman I divorced made it look\nlike the reason for our breakup was something related to\nhow much of a useless man I was...%K%P
让自己的前妻帮自己付餐费什么的，\n离婚的原因看起来不就像是\n『妻子实在受不了丈夫的窝囊』了吗。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo... it's nothing.\d%K%P
「不…没什么」%K%P
I decided to refrain from saying it out loud. If she had\nreplied with something along the lines of \dbut that's\nexactly how it was\d, my pride would never have recovered.%K%P
…如果别人跟我说『反正这就是真的』，\n我不但没法反对，还会沮丧得一蹶不振\n——这我是不会跟别人说的。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThen... try shifting your viewpoint a little.\d%K%P
「那么啊…试着改变一下视角吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMy viewpoint...? What do you mean?\d%K%P
「视角…指的是？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThink of this cake as my attempt to atone for what I\ndid.\d%K%P
「嗯，如果把这块蛋糕，\n当作是我的赎罪之证呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut you have nothing to atone for...\d%K%P
「罪过什么的，我不觉得你有啊」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dLook, it's just an example. It's been two years already.\nHow long are you planning to let this affect you?\d%K%P
「那当然啦。显然只是我打个比方而已。\n毕竟都过去两年多了，\n那么长时间的强拉硬拽我可受不了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dA-Ah... I'm sorry.\nI didn't mean... to sound harsh.\d%K%P
「啊、啊啦…抱歉。\n难道，刚才的话让你受伤了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dD-Don't worry, I'm okay.\d%K%P
「不、不是…没这种事…」%K%P
I wondered if I'd be able to recover from this.%K%P
不但没法反对，还会沮丧得一蹶不振…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI-I'm sorry, I shouldn't have said that! Forget it!\d%K%P
「抱、抱歉，我说了多余的话！\n忘掉刚才的话吧！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-It's okay. I mean, you only said the truth.\d%K%P
「没、没事了、已经…\n反正这就是真的」%K%P
Even in this air-conditioned room, I could feel beads of\nsweat slowly dripping down my forehead.%K%P
空调效果良好的室内，我的汗依然不停地从额头滴下。%K%P
A person's mind was truly a mysterious thing -- a single\ncomment could cause such an exaggerated autonomic nerve\nresponse.%K%P
在一瞬间，自律神经就能受到这样戏剧性的影响，\n人的心灵还真是厉害的东西啊…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, um... cheer up! I know! I'll treat you to dessert!\nYou've always been fond of Shanzeriya's cakes, right?!\d%K%P
「啊、啊～，呃，打起精神来吧！\n对啦！请你吃甜点哦！好吗？\n理，你很喜欢香泽里拉的蛋糕不是吗！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCould you also order one for Mitoko?\nI'm helping her study later today.\d%K%P
「…可以允许我顺便捎回美都子的份吗？\n今天，是家教日」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Oh. Really.\d%K%P
「………啊，这样」%K%P
......%K%P
………%K%P
...%K%P
……%K%P
