「…呃，我可以吃这个吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGo ahead.\nI'm already full from your stories.\d%K%P
「请随意～。\n我光只是听他说话就已经饱了～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dGuess I won't hold back, then... nmh, delish!\nGotta love this cheap-tasting sweetness.\d%K%P
「那我就不客气………嗯，好吃。\n浓厚香甜还便宜」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThat's Shanzeriya for you -- the most balanced restaurant\nin the country in terms of cost versus performance. Can I\nhave a bite, too?\d%K%P
「毕竟是性价比方面无法效仿的香泽里拉的呢…\n我也可以吃吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI thought that one was Osamu's.\d%K%P
「那不是理君的份吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOh, it's okay.\nThere's no place for a divorced guy in this room.\d%K%P
「啊～，好啦好啦。\n领过证的，暂时被禁止出入这里了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Did you force him out?\d%K%P
「…难不成，是你赶出去的？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHe's probably all bummed out in his room right about\nnow.\d%K%P
「现在大概还在房间里抱着膝盖发呆着吧」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI feel for the guy.\d%K%P
「理君真可怜…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou always keep taking his side.\nAnd I can't believe you really ate it just like that.\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐，真亏你能庇护那家伙呢？\n…而且还能满不在乎地吃着」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHey, the cake didn't do anything to you, did it?\nIt doesn't matter if it's his ex-wife who bought it.\d%K%P
「因为蛋糕是无罪的嘛。\n…就算是前妻买给她的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat pisses me off is how he's not even trying to hide\nit. Not a shred of delicacy in him.\d%K%P
「死心眼地收下这种东西，\n这种不纤细不是很让人火大嘛」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYeah... Laid-off should learn when to keep his mouth\nshut.\d%K%P
「也是呢。\n失业的要是不特意地多嘴就好了嘛」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou were the one who added oil to the fire, though.\d%K%P
「八须永君刚才明明也在火上浇油」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHey, I really saw it! The princess and Laid-off were\nholding hands in the middle of the street!\d%K%P
「不不，我真的看见了！\n光天化日之下，公主和失业的在道路正中间，\n手与手握得紧紧的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUghghghg...\d%K%P
「唔唔唔唔唔～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAnd you keep adding more, I see.\d%K%P
「好像，是实时注心的样子呢」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI love this high-calorie taste.\nNo need to waste cash on dinner for me tonight.\d%K%P
「嗯，一刹那卡路里很高的味道很棒呢。\n这样的话今天的晚饭钱就剩出来了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dGuess I'll have to skip a meal because of this.\nOr maybe I should just stop here.\d%K%P
「我也必须要节食一餐呢。\n还是说，这种量放着不管也没关系吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUhhhh... why are you so okay with this?\d%K%P
「唔唔唔唔…为什么这么不在乎啊？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhat do you mean?\d%K%P
「指的是？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
