「夏夜小姐，不是一直黏着失业先生的吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHmm... In a way, I'm still kind of doing that, I guess.\d%K%P
「嗯～，现在大概也在追着吧？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dKind of?\d%K%P
「为啥是推断型？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen why doesn't it piss you off he keeps meeting with\nMs. Kouno behind our backs?\d%K%P
「可是啊，\n他悄悄地去和老师会面，你不生气吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Why am I getting lectured by Miss Number One?\d%K%P
「…嘛，就算你这个大本命这么说也…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHow can you remain so calm about this?\nI mean, personally, it's been a while since I got this\nworked up...\d%K%P
「为什么这么淡定啊？\n我可是，久违地又…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI could hear the sound of that slap even in my room.\d%K%P
「就算在我的房间里都能听得见呢。\n啪～的一声」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDidn't they meet to discuss your school?\d%K%P
「但是啊，那两个人会见面，\n多半是要讨论房东小姐升学的话题吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUh...\d%K%P
「呜…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDoesn't it ring a bell? Like, did either of them\nrecommend you a cram school or a textbook recently?\d%K%P
「想象不到吗？\n又是推荐补习班，又是买参考书什么的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I was asked if I wanted to try my luck at getting a\nscholarship.\d%K%P
「………的确问过我是不是要参加\n免费生的考试什么的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSee? You got ahead of yourself again.\nDon't you think you're a bit too possessive?\d%K%P
「你看～嘛。贸然的姑娘。\n独占欲是不是有点太强了呢？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGhh...\d%K%P
「咕…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBesides, almost everything that Osamu does is motivated\nby you in one way or another. ...Geez.\d%K%P
「本来，理君的行动，\n基本就是围绕着房东小姐为中心来回转的。\n…真是的」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHe's been pretty bad company as of late, preferring to\nlook after the li'l landlord's studies instead of hanging\nout with us.\d%K%P
「最近，因为忙着做房东小妹的家教，\n基本上都不和我们一起玩了…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYeah, it's a sad thing to be ignored despite all my\napproaches.\d%K%P
「啊啊，作为诱受很是寂寞呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Your skills are top-notch, but the way you use 'em\nsucks.\d%K%P
「…真的是，技术最牛但段子却最差劲呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dS-Still... is being fed by your ex-wife and even getting\ncakes from her something to brag about to everyone?\d%K%P
「但、但是啊…\n就算是那样，老师又是给他买吃的、又是给他礼物什么的，\n有必要特意说出来吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDo you seriously think Osamu can take being thanked for\nsomething he hasn't done himself?\d%K%P
「对于他人的亲切，理君是无法忍住不去感谢的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMhhh...\d%K%P
「呣呜呜…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI don't think you can win this, Young Mistress.\d%K%P
「这样就输了一局吧，小房东…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBesides, don't you think the very fact he's so honest\nabout it means he hasn't done any of the things you're so\nworried about?\d%K%P
「而无法包容这种事、特意地说出来，\n是不是有些不讲道理啊？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWh-What about Himeo, then...?\d%K%P
「那、那么，姫绪姐那边又是…？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou can ask him yourself directly.\nIf he's got nothing to hide, he'll tell you everything.\d%K%P
「直接向本人问不就好了嘛。\n问心无愧的话肯定会回答你的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDid you get it?\d%K%P
「理解了吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI got that I was pathetic and dumb.\d%K%P
「你是说我这是不讲道理么…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYep, that means you're finally on the right track.\d%K%P
「嗯，就是这样吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGeez... It's like I'm some spoiled brat.\d%K%P
「不要啊…\n这样的话我不就像是小孩子一样了嘛」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, aren't you?\d%K%P
「不，你本来就是小孩子吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGrhrhr...\d%K%P
「呶唔唔…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHere, I left half of the cake for you.\nHave something sweet to calm you down.\d%K%P
「你看，我留了一半蛋糕哦。\n吃点甜点，冷静一下如何？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dH-How come you understand him so well?\d%K%P
「夏、夏夜小姐为什么能理解到这个程度…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dIs it the blood of #2?\d%K%P
「是二号（小三）之血造就的么…？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, that's... hmm...\d%K%P
「不，嘛，这个…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou weren't like this before.\nI'm pretty sure you were a lot less confident, weren't\nyou.\d%K%P
「之前你可不是这样的哦？\n一点都不从容哦？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dY-You really think so...?\d%K%P
「这、这样吗…？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah, when we found out that Ms. Kouno was the first\nperson Mr. Laid-off told about his new job, you were as\nupset as me.\d%K%P
「上个月，失业先生再就业…\n他一开始去找老师报告的时候，你可是很消沉啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOh, I gotta hit the sack. Got work tomorrow and all\nthat.\d%K%P
「啊～明天还有工作得早点睡了～嗯！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...Perhaps I should take that bet, after all.\d%K%P
「…那场赌注，我是不是应该接下来呢？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHello. This is Tokushige Commerce.\d%K%P
「受您照顾了。\n这里是德重商会」%K%P
\dAh, hello. I'm Maeda from Minagishi Production.\nIs Mr. Yoshimura in the office right now?\d%K%P
「啊～抱歉。\n我是皆岸物产的前田，\n请问芳村先生在吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「诶………？」%K%P
\dErr... Mr. Yoshimura... from Sales...?\d%K%P
「不，我是在说芳村先生。业务员」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dUm... did you perhaps mean, um, Osa--\nI mean, Yoshimura Osamu?\d%K%P
「业务员芳村…那个，我有些不确定，\n您是说理（君）…芳村理吗？」%K%P
\dHuh? His name? ...Ah, that's right, it was Mr. Yoshimura\nOsamu. Could I get Mr. Osamu on the phone?\d%K%P
「呃～，名字？\n………啊啊，对的对的，芳村理先生。\n请帮我找一下理先生」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶………？」%K%P
\dHuh? This is Tokushige Commerce, correct?\d%K%P
「咦？不是德重商会吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dY-Yes, that is correct, but Yoshimura Osamu is not\ncurrently--\d%K%P
「是、是的，虽然是这样…\n那个，弊社的芳村理…」%K%P
\dHe's not there? I thought you guys were the old Houei\nCommerce.\d%K%P
「芳村先生不在吗？\n贵处不是邦永商会的再建公司吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEh? Ah, um... we are, but...\d%K%P
「诶？啊、啊啊…\n那个，嘛，虽说的确是这样」%K%P
\dThen Mr. Yoshimura must be there. Or could it be that\nhe's doing the rounds again and barely ever comes back to\nthe office?\d%K%P
「那应该在的吧芳村先生。\n难道说，又去外面奔走，\n几乎都不回来吗？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dN-No, you are correct, we are indeed the former Houei\nCommerce, but Yoshimura is not currently employed by us.\d%K%P
「不、不是，这里原来的确是邦永商会，\n那个，芳村…………在弊社」%K%P
\dHuh? He quit?! Damn, I heard you guys re-established\nyourselves, so I was hoping I could find him.\d%K%P
「诶～，辞职了吗？\n这算啥啊～，听邦永先生说要重建公司，\n我还以为芳村先生一定会在呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, I'm truly sorry about that...\nI'll get you in touch with the current person in charge.\d%K%P
「啊、不，非常抱歉…\n我这就给您接当前的负责人」%K%P
\dErr, that's okay, don't bother... There's no point in\nreturning to Houei if Yoshimura's not with you anymore.\d%K%P
「啊～，算了，算了。\n芳村先生不在的话，我回邦永就没有意义了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dA-Are you sure...?\d%K%P
「是、是这样吗…？」%K%P
\dIt's not like we're having any issues with Kagoshima\nSales. I just thought it'd be nice to work with Mr.\nYoshimura again, that's all.\d%K%P
「现在的儿岛销售，倒也不是完全不行。\n我只是在想，如果能和芳村先生共事的话要不要回来呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
\dWas he snatched up by some other place before you guys\nhad the chance to set everything up? I can't imagine that\nguy being without a job for too long.\d%K%P
「就是那个吧？\n在公司重建前，被哪个公司挖墙脚了吧？\n那个人可是根本闲不住呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dU-Um, I'm sorry, but have you known Yoshimura for long?\nDid you work with him when he was at Kamata Trading?\d%K%P
「那、那个，很失礼地问一句，您和芳村以前就认识？\n那个，难道在镰田商事的时候就有过交情吗？」%K%P
\dOh, so he actually worked for Kamata?\nWell, no wonder he got taken by someone else, then.\d%K%P
「啊～，那个人还在镰田呆过啊，果然啊。\n也是啊，他肯定很抢手」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
\dI don't know him from those times. I met him when he came\nto us in May and kept apologizing for everything, even\nthough we were shouting at him on pretty much a daily\nbasis.\d%K%P
「之前我不认识他的。只是５月的时候每天他都会过来。\n而且不管这边如何怒吼，\n他也只是一个劲儿地道歉呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSo it's from back then...\d%K%P
「那个时候的…」%K%P
\dIt was the first time I met a weird sales representative\nlike that. He even went out of his way to find things for\nus from manufacturers that had nothing to do with him.\d%K%P
「我还是第一次见到那么奇怪的业务员呢。\n特地在和自己没有关系的厂商之间奔走，\n集全了所有的商品啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHahh...\d%K%P
「哈啊…」%K%P
\dEventually, we let it get to our heads, so we started\nasking him for consumable goods on top of the office\nmachinery, and he -still- got everything for us with a\nsmile.\d%K%P
「而且在中途这边还由着性子，\n不只让他负责办公自动化机器，还把耗材拜托给了他，\n他也没有摆一个脸色就帮我们筹措好了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI see...\d%K%P
「那是…」%K%P
\dAnd then he even introduced us to other providers when\nyour company went under. It was quite unfortunate that had\nto happen.\d%K%P
「最后自己的公司破产了，\n还给我们介绍新的客户…\n我真是感到非常遗憾啊」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm... sorry.\d%K%P
「非常…抱歉」%K%P
\dAh, my apologies for making you listen to all that\nrambling.\nI got somewhat nostalgic about the whole thing all of a\nsudden.\d%K%P
「啊啊，我才该说抱歉。\n谈了这么久已经不在了的人的事…不知不觉就怀念起来了呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dNo, it's okay. ...I was happy... to hear it.\d%K%P
「不，才没有这种事。\n…我非常、高兴」%K%P
\dHuh...? At any rate, I'll be hanging up.\nTell Yoshimura I said... ah, right, he's not there. Silly\nme.\d%K%P
「哈啊…？\n啊，那就失礼了。\n请向芳村先生致意…啊，已经不在了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'll tell him...!\d%K%P
「我会传达到的…」%K%P
\dOh? Okay, then. It was nice talking to you.\d%K%P
「？\n那么，就先失礼了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...!\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMan
%LC邻座的男人
\dThey were asking about Yoshimura again? We still get\nthose calls from time to time. You wouldn't believe it,\nbut back when we were just starting up, the office was\nflooded by these kind of calls.\d%K%P
「『芳村先生在吗？』吧？\n就算是现在，有时也会有这种电话呢。\n…最开始的时候老是接到这种电话」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dReally...?\d%K%P
「是…这样吗？」%K%P
%LCMan
%LC邻座的男人
