「咿、呜、呜呜…咕…\n笨、笨蛋、笨蛋笨蛋…芳村理这个笨蛋」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dStop making me cry...\nDon't make me fall for you even more!\nUah, uaaahh... fwehhh...\d%K%P
「别让我哭了…\n别让我，更加迷恋你了啊！\n呜、呜呜…呜啊啊啊…」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWh... What's up with these problems?!\d%K%P
「这…这是啥啊这个问题！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThey're simple, aren't they?\nJust think of this test as an introductory one.\d%K%P
「很简单吧？\n嘛，我想是入门篇吧」%K%P
Mitoko let out a wild scream as she looked at my hand-\nwritten problem sheet, and glared at me with indignant\neyes.%K%P
拿到我手写的讲义的瞬间，\n美都子发出了抓狂的呼喊，\n带着恨意狠狠地盯向了我。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo way... I was never taught this binary thing...\d%K%P
「怎么会…二进制什么的没学过啦～！」%K%P
I only gave her a few unorthodox problems that weren't\npart of her textbook.%K%P
明明只是出了一点超纲的问题。%K%P
In that moment, I felt as though I could maybe understand\nthe sentiment of all those grandpas complaining about\nchildren these days being too quick to get upset.%K%P
『最近的孩子真是不争气』这种大叔气息的感叹，\n说不定能让她多少理解一点，\n嘛，无所谓啦。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou have a computing class, don't you? I thought you'd be\nfamiliar with binary by now. Okay, let's give it a try...\nWhat would the number three be in binary?\d%K%P
「最近应该上过计算机之类的课吧？\n我还以为你会挺熟悉二进制什么的。\n问你一下，十进制的３对应的二进制是？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dU-Um... t-ten... eleven?\d%K%P
「那、那个………１、１０…１１？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHey, you got it.\nI'm sure you can solve this one, too.\d%K%P
「什么嘛，这不是知道的嘛。\n那，这个肯定会很容易就能解开吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThree and 0.625 are completely different!\d%K%P
「３和０．６２５完全不一样啊！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut the logic is the same.\d%K%P
「思考方式是一样的哦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAt least give me a hint...\d%K%P
「至少给点提示吧～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI won't. This problem is all about figuring out the\nsimple trick behind it, so any hint I'd give would pretty\nmuch solve it on its own.\d%K%P
「不行。\n这个问题，就是考察你能不能注意到那个窍门，\n给你提示的话，就相当于直接告诉你答案了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWh-What's the point of this thing? The entrance exams\nwon't have any problems they don't teach at school.\d%K%P
「再、再说啊，\n学校里不教的东西考试应该是不会出题的吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou might think so, but this one is actually a problem\nthat I encountered during my entrance exam. Private\nschools do that sometimes.\d%K%P
「不过这个，是过去我考的时候出的题啊。\n…私立学校经常会干这种事」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHow long ago was that? I'm pretty sure unfair problems\nlike that have since been outlawed.\d%K%P
「都过去多久了啊。\n现在肯定不会出这种犯规的问题了吧」%K%P
...Maybe they were.%K%P
…实际上大概的确如此。%K%P
After all, the curriculum I'd been familiar with was over\nten years old, and came from the Gifu prefecture.%K%P
毕竟我所了解的教育要领，\n可是来自于十多年前的岐阜县。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm testing your ability to deal with unexpected\nproblems. It doesn't matter whether or not this particular\none will be on the test.\d%K%P
「不管遇到怎样的偏题，\n都需要有不慌不忙正常应对的柔韧性。\n实际上能不能解出来并不重要」%K%P
However, I couldn't allow myself to show weakness.%K%P
但是，这种弱气并不能在这里表现出来，\n这里需要贯彻『我就是教育要领』的精神。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy does your personality suddenly change when you're\nteaching me, Mr. Laid-off?\d%K%P
「失业先生…只有在教我学习的时候人格才会变吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, let's do our best.\nYou can take a break after you solve this.\d%K%P
「不管怎样，加油吧。\n解完这个题就休息吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou monster! Devil! Totem pole!\nYou're a loser who can't even let go of his ex-wife!\d%K%P
「魔鬼～、恶魔～、图腾柱～、\n总想着分手的老婆的喋喋不休的男人～！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAre you still trying to get back at me for that last\none...?\d%K%P
「不要把对上次事情的报复微妙地混杂进去啊…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm back!\d%K%P
「我回来了～♪」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOh?\d%K%P
「哦呀？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, Mr. Retired!\nAre you enjoying the evening air?\d%K%P
「啊，老爷子，在乘晚凉？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIndeed I am, and welcome back.\nYou seem to be in awfully high spirits.\d%K%P
「嗯，欢迎回来。\n你心情非常好呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEh? You really think so?\nI think I'm the same as always.\d%K%P
「诶～，这样吗？\n我是觉得跟平时没啥区别呢」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dAnd there's a most delicious smell lingering about.\nDo I sense a celebration of sorts approaching?\d%K%P
「而且身上的味道也很好闻呢。\n这是…宴会的预感？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI felt generous today and brought everyone some beer and\nwine. And also some of that stuff you like. Here.\d%K%P
「稍～微破费了一点吧算是。\n啤酒和葡萄酒，老爷子喜欢的东西，给」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOh, you've just made me a very happy man. This thingie is\nused for medicine, so it's perfect for my old, cold\nbones.\d%K%P
「哦哦，真让人开心啊。\n因为是药用的，对四肢冰凉很有好处呢这个」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt stinks pretty bad, though.\nIs everyone back?\d%K%P
「…因为是药用所以有药味啊。\n大家都回来了？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOf course. The Young Master is about the only one who\never leaves this house, at any rate.\d%K%P
「嗯，都回来了。\n本来除了小少爷外大家也都不出门就是了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSo where is this Osamu, without whom we cannot start?\d%K%P
「那，关键的理君呢？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...You cannot start without him, Ms. #2? Well, okay.\nIt seems like something truly nice happened to you today.\d%K%P
「…说到重点了啊，你这二号小姐。\n看来真的发生了什么好事呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEhehe, don't mind the details.\nSo, is he inside?\d%K%P
「诶嘿嘿，嘛，这不是挺好的吗。\n在吗？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHe is. He is... however, I believe he's slightly busy\nright now.\d%K%P
「在的。\n虽然在…但稍微有点忙呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou mean... he's over there?\d%K%P
「…那么，对方是？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dThe Young Mistress has finally become serious about\nadvancing her studies, and that seems to have lit a fire\nwithin the Young Master.\d%K%P
「不管怎样，小房东对自己的升学问题似乎很积极呢。\n小少爷也非常上心」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWeren't those two fighting just yesterday?\d%K%P
「不过，直到昨天还在吵架的吧？\n那两个人」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dNo, that happens every other day -- the heart of our\nlandlord is as fickle as the sky above a snow-laden\nmountain.\d%K%P
「什么啊，不是一直这样吗。\n我们这边也有『房东之心如雪山之空』的说法」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...I didn't know it was that bad.\d%K%P
「…真是风雪交加啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dPheeeew... I'm finally done...\d%K%P
「呼～～～…做完了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dGreat. Let's have a ten-minute break, then.\d%K%P
「辛苦了。\n那么，要休息１０分钟吗」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI feel like I used up a week's worth of my brain\ncapacity...\nMy head's about to explode.\d%K%P
「感觉用了一周份的精力啊…知识快要烧起来了」%K%P
Since Mitoko was slumped over her desk and refused to\nmove, I decided that I would make the tea tonight.%K%P
代替趴倒在桌子上的美都子，\n今日由我来往茶壶里倒水。%K%P
At first, she really hated the problems I prepared for\nher, but as I gave her some hints and explanations, her\nindignation soon gave way for a genuine thirst of\nknowledge.%K%P
我出的题目，虽然在最开始受到了超级差评，\n但她听完我的解说，脑子转一下弯，\n不知何时眼睛又恢复了光彩，认真地听我讲。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou know... you're actually pretty smart, aren't you, Mr.\nLaid-off?\d%K%P
「不过话说回来…\n失业先生，你真是聪明啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn the past, all I ever did was study.\nIt didn't help me much in adult society, though.\d%K%P
「因为我以前总是在学习啊。\n…虽然进入社会后也起不到什么作用吧」%K%P
I graduated from an elite university and went on to join\nan elite company... only to drop out a few years later.%K%P
离开了公认的好大学，进入了好公司，\n然后被漂亮地抛出。%K%P
I wondered when I stopped being able to take compliments.%K%P
…话说，为什么就算被夸奖我也不会坦率地感到喜悦呢。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm not just talking just about your knowledge, but the\nway you teach, too... You're good at, um, motivating\nothers, I guess.\d%K%P
「不，不只是知识，该说是教的方法吗…\n大概是很擅长让人鼓起干劲吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's only because I have a student worth teaching. It's\na nice feeling to look at someone doing their best to keep\nup with you.\d%K%P
「那是托了你这个可教之才的福哦。\n如此努力地跟着我的节奏，我很开心啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou're just being modest. You're like an actual teacher.\n...In fact, you might be better than Ms. Kouno, now that I\nthink about it.\d%K%P
「你那是谦虚。就像是专业的老师一样啊。\n…比起香野老师教的，可能还容易懂啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...!\d%K%P
「唔…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...(stare)\d%K%P
「………（盯～）」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um...\d%K%P
「那、那个…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...(staaare)\d%K%P
「………（盯～）」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Hahh.\d%K%P
「…哈啊」%K%P
...So that was on purpose.%K%P
…对啊，刚才的发言，是故意的吧。%K%P
I had to explain this to her, picking my words carefully.%K%P
就是说，我虽然选择了正确的话语，\n但也必须要把话跟她讲清楚才行。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um, Mitoko.\d%K%P
「那、那个啊，美都子」%K%P
Still remembering the last time she slapped me across the\nface, I slowly opened my mouth...%K%P
一边回想起之前面颊上挨的耳光的感触，\n我斟酌着词语张开嘴…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI wonder if I'm being possessive...\d%K%P
「我啊，是不是独占欲太强了呢…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
The abruptness of her remark left me speechless.%K%P
但是又一次，突然之间的展开，\n让我顿时失语。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMs. Kaya told me I was acting like a child.\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐这么说的。说我是小孩子」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「哈…？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dShe said that I keep getting jealous for no reason when\nyou actually consider me your number one.\d%K%P
「她说，失业先生明明一直把我当作最优先的考虑对象，\n我却总是不顾后果地吃醋」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-Ms. Kaya said that?!\d%K%P
「夏、夏夜小姐这么说的！？」%K%P
That sounded like a high-minded thing to say. And I could\ndefinitely imagine her saying it.%K%P
如果那真是这个人说的，\n某种意义上，还真是挺有那个人风格的达观措辞啊…%K%P
Still, I couldn't help but wonder if that was really how\nshe felt, given our relationship.%K%P
而某种意义上『那是你说的吗』这种性质上的内情，\n一下一下地扎着我的心。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, Mr. Laid-off...\d%K%P
「呐，失业先生…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dDid you meet Ms. Kouno to discuss my continued\nschooling?\d%K%P
「和老师见面，\n是为了讨论我升学的事吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou told me everything because you had nothing to hide,\nright?\d%K%P
「老实说出来的话，\n肯定就是问心无愧的了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko...\d%K%P
「美都子…」%K%P
Toko uttered quite the perplexing question while still\nbeing slumped over the desk with her back turned to me.%K%P
美都子趴在桌子上，\n我看不到她脸上的表情，\n而她就这样向我抛来了一个非常微妙的、不知该如何分类是好的疑问。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt shouldn't even really be my business who you meet or\nwhat you do with them.\d%K%P
「实际上呢，失业先生和谁见面干什么，\n本来跟我是没有一点关系的呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell...\d%K%P
「那个是…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI know I'm being unreasonable, but I can't help being\ncurious, so I'll still ask. Is that really all you were\nmeeting Ms. Kouno for?\d%K%P
「也许你会觉得我不讲理，但我还是很在意，所以就问你了哦？\n和老师，真的只是因为这个才会见面的吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Yes.\d%K%P
「…是的」%K%P
Mitoko was most likely overtaken by an emotion she herself\ncouldn't quite explain as her words left her mouth as soon\nas she thought of them.%K%P
美都子自己肯定也还怀着非常微妙的感情，\n因为思考过头，舌头都开始打滑了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAt the very least, our last meeting was definitely just\none of a concerned parent and teacher.\d%K%P
「至少，上次和麻实…香野老师见面，\n毫无疑问，只是以老师和家长的身份的」%K%P
As such, I felt I had to answer her with absolute honesty\nmyself.%K%P
所以与之相对，我想我这边，\n必须要拿出诚意来回答她。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen... what did you talk about with Himeo? I heard you\nwere holding hands in the middle of the street or\nsomething.\d%K%P
「那么…跟姫绪姐讨论的是什么事呢？\n大白天的，非常亲密地拉着手什么的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt was related to my job. I don't think you'll understand\nmuch if I go into the details, but I can try to explain,\nif you want.\d%K%P
「工作的事啊。\n虽然我觉得跟你详细说也说不清楚，\n但如果你想听的话我会从头开始说」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
This girl had been betrayed one too many times.\nAnd I myself had sworn never to lie to her again.%K%P
对这个被背叛过多次的女孩，\n我绝对要保持诚实，\n这是我『不管多少次』都会做出的决定。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOkay... Last question, then...\d%K%P
「那么…最后的提问」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah...?\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
So...%K%P
所以…%K%P
If her last question hit the bullseye, I'd have no choice\nbut to...%K%P
如果美都子最后的提问，\n突入了决定性的问题的话，\n我也没有什么办法。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dCan you eat rice balls with pickled plums now?\d%K%P
「梅干饭团…好像你也能吃了？」%K%P
